<title>TUNISIA: Tunisian treasury raises 20 mln dinars at auction.</title>
<headline>Tunisian treasury raises 20 mln dinars at auction.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia's treasury said it sold 20 million dinars of 13-week bills at its weekly auction on Tuesday, repaying maturing debt totalling 25.157 million dinars.</p>
<p>The 13-week bill was at a 7.9375 percent coupon rate.</p>
<p>Banks bid for 294 million dinars of 13-week, 26-week, 52-week and two-year, three-year, four-year and five-year paper at between 7.9375 and 8.5 percent.</p>
<p>($1=one dinar)</p>
<p>--Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
